#: ../../source/config_output.rst:497
msgid "Naming a file type elsewhere"
msgstr "Nombrar un tipo de archivo de otro paquete"

#: ../../source/config_output.rst:499
msgid ""
"A file type is ordinarily a bare name -- ``step``, ``png`` -- and every "
"package with an opinion about it is layered on top of the built-in one. It "
